    {
      "id": "claim_19d9e1cd58d941d5a04c2829183dcc67",
      "statement": "The OAuth callback trusts identity only from the HMAC-signed state (chatId/openId), not from same-named body fields, because the body is assembled by the forwarding layer while the state was signed by this repo when /login was issued; the signing secret is INTERNAL_TOKEN, which the relay shares as EO_INTERNAL_TOKEN, so both sides can verify without distributing an extra key.",
