    {
      "id": "claim_b857fee2c13c46409a067e86d45f2f94",
      "statement": "The agents route enforces a fail-closed internal-token gate: if INTERNAL_TOKEN is not configured the route returns 503 with instructions rather than serving, since the deployed agents route is publicly reachable and could otherwise be used to burn model quota; a mismatching token returns 401.",
