      "id": "claim_810e21833bad4b1a876fe3e25ad14f77",
      "statement": "The conversation-id length/charset trap and the sticky-routing invariant are pinned by four bare-Node smoke tests in section E: the id is 6–36 characters with a legal charset and a leading fs- (with an explicit assertion that `fs-${REAL_CHAT_ID}` is 38 characters and over the limit), the same chat always maps to the same id, different chats map to different ids, and the forwarding request carries the internal token.",
