    {
      "id": "claim_8094e91e6f3048c4b3c770540ddc862c",
      "statement": "Probe diagnostics depend on the conversation id: ?probe=start and ?probe=check both need the same Makers-Conversation-Id because the marker lives in conversation state, ?probe=last must read the conversation KV to see another instance's diagnostics because its in-memory ring buffer is per-instance, and ?probe=store's cross-session test requires writing under one conversation id and reading under a different one. Probes are GET and edge-cached, so verifying after a code change requires a URL cache-buster.",
